{"id": 1015815, "slug": "fall-asleep-2", "name": "Fall Asleep", "name_original": "Fall Asleep", "description": "<p><strong>Game Overview – Fall Asleep</strong></p><p>Fall Asleep is a tense first-person climbing game where you’re trapped inside a nightmare and the only way out is up. With limited sight from your flashlight, platforms materialize just a few steps ahead, leaving you blind to the greater path and forcing you to trust your instincts. Every jump elevates you closer to escaping the dream. . . or further into the void.</p><p>The nightmare unfolds across <strong>three haunting levels</strong>:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Village</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Neighborhood</strong> </p></li><li><p><strong>Island</strong> </p></li></ul><p><strong>Dev Tips:</strong> Press<strong> F</strong> to access your Flashlight and hold <strong>shift</strong> to Sprint and make those hard-to-reach jumps.</p><p>Fall Asleep makes every step a gamble. There are no checkpoints. No saves. Reaching your bed is the only way to wake yourself from the nightmare. Do you have what it takes to escape?</p>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2025-12-31", "tba": false, "updated": "2026-01-26T11:10:53", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/793/79343205a7e9eab3ec58b42ccadaa9a5.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/b5d/b5d0ee5e0dc409788aceede78696fa1d.jpg", "website": "https://www.overthrowninteractive.com/", "rating": 0.0, "rating_top": 0, "ratings": [], "reactions": null, "added": 0, "added_by_status": null, "playtime": 0, "screenshots_count": 7, "movies_count": 0, "creators_count": 2, "achievements_count": 0, "parent_achievements_count": 0, "reddit_url": "", "reddit_name": "", "reddit_description": "", "reddit_logo": "", "reddit_count": 0, "twitch_count": 0, "youtube_count": 0, "reviews_text_count": 0, "ratings_count": 0, "suggestions_count": 266, "alternative_names": [], "metacritic_url": "", "parents